Staff: Keith Royle $460 a week, 38 hours. With 2 working the shop can serve about 340 a week. Each extra hour worked there serves about four more.

WHAT YOU HAVE AGREED
- job terms: Keith Royle works at Wenlow Bakery & Deli for $460 a week, 38 hours
- appointment ap537: with Hazel Shah on Saturday 28 March about 10-minute Calder for shops call: setup cost, ongoing charges, what Calder does for Wenlow Bakery & Deli queues/stock/bookings

