Sian Bevan: "Of course, Alan — take your time. The $60 arrangement is the repayment plan we set up: I pay $60 a week to Northern Mutual on top of the $43 Thursday repayment, for 20 weeks, to clear Owen's loan faster. What I need from you is just written confirmation that you're happy with it — a short note will do. And on the shop calls, I'd like to get the introduction slots booked; could we find a time this week for you and Hazel to speak?"
