Sian Bevan: "That's very good of you, Alan — a short note is all I need, and I appreciate you being straight about it. On the calls, I'd rather we didn't overpromise either. So let's treat this week as you and Hazel finding a slot, and hold off booking anything firm until after your Calder call on Saturday. Shall I pencil in a check-in with you on the Monday after — the 30th — to see where you've got to?"

